00:00:37.533 --> 00:00:42.517
He's a chemistry major. It's
almost as good as (indistinct).

00:00:42.517 --> 00:00:46.024
Chemistry's a great
subject, not that I'd know.

00:00:46.024 --> 00:00:49.441
And MIT, worked at Harvard Med School,

00:00:50.847 --> 00:00:52.198
worked at Cornell (indistinct).

00:00:52.198 --> 00:00:55.620
He's gonna be able to tell
us more about his career.

00:00:55.620 --> 00:00:57.903
And I think the only
thing you need to know is

00:00:57.903 --> 00:01:02.903
