00:33:09.120 --> 00:33:11.040
you know, to find out what's in it.

00:33:11.040 --> 00:33:14.040
And the reason why they're
in this hazmat suit is

00:33:14.040 --> 00:33:16.170
because these rats are not only,

00:33:16.170 --> 00:33:20.130
I just talked about this
one bacteria, leptospirosis,

00:33:20.130 --> 00:33:25.130
but they are also carriers of a virus,

00:33:27.510 --> 00:33:29.370
which is very easily transmittable.

00:33:29.370 --> 00:33:30.860
It's called hantovirus.

00:33:32.250 --> 00:33:35.850
So every time, you can imagine Salvador

00:33:35.850 --> 00:33:39.630
where we work, the city in
Brazil, it's a tropical climate.

00:33:39.630 --> 00:33:43.200
It's probably 90 degrees, 80% humidity.

00:33:43.200 --> 00:33:45.060
So they're spending the whole day

00:33:45.060 --> 00:33:49.260
