00:33:49.260 --> 00:33:54.150
So, an extraordinary team
of Brazilians and Americans

00:33:54.150 --> 00:33:57.450
and French and English
who have worked together

00:33:57.450 --> 00:33:58.590
to do this study.

00:33:58.590 --> 00:33:59.952
Did I answer your question?

00:33:59.952 --> 00:34:01.800
- [Audience Member 3]
Yeah, so they're dissecting

00:34:01.800 --> 00:34:03.810
to understand what's...

00:34:03.810 --> 00:34:05.710
- [Albert] What's in those rats, yeah,

00:34:06.600 --> 00:34:09.570
for leptospirosis and off and on, yeah.

00:34:09.570 --> 00:34:13.410
All right, good. So that's a good example.

