00:36:28.110 --> 00:36:30.840
doesn't flow into our play space,

00:36:30.840 --> 00:36:32.730
it stays in those sewers.

00:36:32.730 --> 00:36:35.160
The second thing is that, that distance,

00:36:35.160 --> 00:36:37.860
remember that slide that I showed

00:36:37.860 --> 00:36:39.810
with all those rat burrows?

00:36:39.810 --> 00:36:42.600
Those are right next to
