00:36:42.600 --> 00:36:45.540
They have no option but to every day,

00:36:45.540 --> 00:36:49.710
walk through that area
whereas in New York,

00:36:49.710 --> 00:36:50.940
if you see 'em in the sewer,

00:36:50.940 --> 00:36:52.950
they're not right by where we are, right?

00:36:52.950 --> 00:36:55.290
And usually we're not barefoot, right?

00:36:55.290 --> 00:36:59.220
So we have several barriers
that protect us, okay?

00:36:59.220 --> 00:37:03.210
This is why this is a
disease of the poor, okay?

00:37:03.210 --> 00:37:06.990
It's a disease that we see
in tropical climates, okay,

00:37:06.990 --> 00:37:10.830
and it's a disease that we rarely see

00:37:10.830 --> 00:37:12.693
unless you're traveling to Hawaii.

00:37:13.530 --> 00:37:15.150
They have leptospirosis in Hawaii,

00:37:15.150 --> 00:37:17.460
so anyone seen all the
